      "title": "Scene beats (change me)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Scene: a pirate captain alone in his cramped wooden cabin at night. Beats: 1) He studies a sea chart on the table by lantern light. 2) Close-up: the needle of a brass pocket compass on the chart spins wildly. 3) He looks up sharply toward the cabin door. 4) He grabs his coat and heads for the door. 5) He throws the door open onto a stormy deck. 6) Wide shot from the deck: lightning shows a huge ship bearing down on them. Panels: 6. Pirate captain: a man in his early 30s with dark curly hair, a mustard-yellow durag, an open linen shirt and a dark leather vest. Location: a low, beamed ship's cabin lit by one hanging brass lantern."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "Scene: a pirate captain alone in his cramped wooden cabin at night. Beats: 1) He studies a sea chart on the table by lantern light. 2) Close-up: the needle of a brass pocket compass on the chart spins wildly. 3) He looks up sharply toward the cabin door. 4) He grabs his coat and heads for the door. 5) He throws the door open onto a stormy deck. 6) Wide shot from the deck: lightning shows a huge ship bearing down on them. Panels: 6. Pirate captain: a man in his early 30s with dark curly hair, a mustard-yellow durag, an open linen shirt and a dark leather vest. Location: a low, beamed ship's cabin lit by one hanging brass lantern."
      }
