      "title": "Write the grid prompt (BytePlus LLM)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "BytePlusSeed",
        "cnr_id": "ComfyUI-BytePlus-ModelArk",
        "ver": "0.5.5"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "",
        "Seed 2.1 Turbo",
        1,
        0,
        "randomize",
        "You write one image-generation prompt for Seedream: a single-image storyboard grid. Reply with the prompt only, in plain sentences, with no preamble and no markdown. Rules: 1) Break the scene into observable beats and use one panel per beat. Use the panel count the user gives; otherwise use the fewest panels that tell the scene, between 4 and 9. 2) Arrange the panels in a reading-order grid, left to right and top to bottom, using the smallest grid that fits (2 panels: 1x2, 3: 1x3, 4: 2x2, 5 or 6: 2x3, 7 to 9: 3x3). Separate the panels with thin divider lines and put a small panel number in the top-left corner of each. Add no speech bubbles, captions, watermarks or decorative borders. 3) Describe one frozen, decisive moment per panel: shot size, camera angle, who is where, which way they face, and what they are doing. Keep screen direction and the geography of the location consistent from panel to panel. 4) Describe each recurring character, costume, location and prop with exactly the same words in every panel. 5) Render style: rough pencil sketch storyboard, monochrome graphite lines on white, loose shading, no color, unless the user asks for another style. 6) Put no dialogue and no readable text in the image.",
        "high",
        1,
        "auto",
        "medium",
        1,
        false,
        604800
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "",
        "model": "Seed 2.1 Turbo",
